  l4: "On that machine (not on your own computer), paste the <b>one command</b> from the top of this page.",
  l5: "If <code>SUB=</code> is empty, create a network first: Networking → Virtual cloud networks → Start VCN Wizard → “Create VCN with Internet Connectivity”. If Cloud Shell restarts, paste the script again.",
